load @term/seed/code/structure/space/vector
  find vector-space

# A hyperbola: the conic of points whose distances to two foci differ by a constant, a curve of two opposing branches
# with straight asymptotes. It is the level set of x squared minus y squared, the shape of the Lorentzian interval, and
# the boundary between the timelike and spacelike directions of spacetime. The form carries the plane it lives in.
form hyperbola
  link plane, like vector-space
